  I.Same (Becoming.Stretches.pickedRun pick mem beyond).stretches
@Becoming.Stretches.classification : ∀ {S : Type u_1} {A : Type u_2} {P : Generative.Process S A}
  {I : Becoming.Ideals.Ideal (Becoming.stretchOrder P)},
